## 📊 Database Schema Reference

### ID Formats
```
Lead ID:    LD-SOLAR-SURAT-27202512-004
            ↓   ↓     ↓      ↓        ↓
         Prefix Service City  Date   Sequence

Vendor ID:  VD-SOLAR-SURAT-001
            ↓   ↓     ↓      ↓
         Prefix Service City Sequence

Vendor Lead: Lead #001, Lead #002, Lead #003
```

### Tables Overview
```sql
users           → Authentication (admin/vendor)
vendors         → Vendor profiles & credits
leads           → Customer requirements
lead_assignments → Lead to vendor mapping
payments        → Credit purchases
lead_sequences  → Auto-increment tracking
```

